 A novel Cu-based catalyst $\mathtt{C u}/$ $\mathsf{C u}_{\mathrm{x}}\mathsf{O@C N}$ was prepared by a facile method.   
· $\mathsf{C u}/\mathsf{C u}_{\mathrm{x}}\mathsf{O@C N}$ exhibits extremely high catalytic activity in 4-nitrophenol reduction.   
